iry or garbage-collection behaviour, and the binding this entry replaces named OpenProjection with the same two storage acceptance cases already used by the Section 3.3 binding.'}, {'key': 'section:11.10.5', 'gap': 'Section 11.10.5 defines the upstream public synthetic admission validator, not a runtime requirement to parse SPEC.md during AX host admission. TASK-260830-2x16gz consumes its vectors as source evidence only and implements no policy reader; synthetic passes never establish executed product support. Pending implementation owner: TASK-260830-2x16gz.', 'evidence': 'The pinned section explicitly calls the predicates synthetic execution context and separates detailed DER, custody and runtime boundaries from policy witnesses. No policy-reader declaration exists in the tree; production host-channel admission is proven by the AC-HOST-001 suite over the real Dial/Serve/Call entries instead.'}, {'key': 'section:14.7.1', 'gap': 'Section 14.7.1 requires literal first-at source-qualified selector grammar with configured source-index resolution; no selector parser or source index exists. Pending implementation owner: TASK-260830-21gygk.', 'evidence': 'No CLI session commands exist at all: the tree builds no ax binary, sessadapter SourceSelector validates directory-protocol members rather than CLI selectors, and Section 2.3 name precedence is shape validation only.'}, {'key': 'section:14.7.2', 'gap': 'Section 14.7.2 requires resolve-once fact binding with revalidation before execution; no selection planner or bound-fact store exists. Pending implementation owner: TASK-260830-21gygk.', 'evidence': 'Nothing binds selection facts to execution: there is no selector resolver whose output could go stale, and no plan revalidation reads a source index.'}, {'key': 'section:14.7.3', 'gap': 'Section 14.7.3 binds the five Structured Error 1.4.0 codes to exits exclusively inside CLI Result 5; no Go mapping carries those codes. Pending implementation owner: TASK-260830-1i7bqr.', 'evidence': 'The axerror registry is closed over Structured Error 1.0.0 through 1.3.0 with 109 codes; the 1.4.0 code-to-exit mapping has no implementation and no emitter.'}, {'key': 'section:14.7.4', 'gap': 'Section 14.7.4 requires interrupted record-only creation with authoritative bootstrap recovery; no chooser, bootstrap creation or recovery flow exists. Pending implementation owner: TASK-260830-1wb06o.', 'evidence': 'No session creation path exists in the tree: there is no CLI create command, no chooser, and no bootstrap lease issuance that an interruption could leave record-only.'}, {'key': 'section:14.7.5', 'gap': 'Section 14.7.5 defines the upstream selector publication evaluator and its source-only case inventory. Source publication does not attest runtime provenance, temporal boundaries or running AX implementation; product selector conformance remains pending. Pending implementation owner: TASK-260830-1i7bqr.', 'evidence': 'The pinned section explicitly distinguishes the publication evaluator from runtime authority/durability obligations. Upstream source publication ownership remains agent-session-manager-spec; TASK-260830-1i7bqr owns product-level composed conformance using the shared resolver and lifecycle APIs.'}]\\n===PIN===\\n40:\\t// reviewedOwnershipCanonicalSHA256 pins the semantic JSON projection. JSON\\n43:\\treviewedOwnershipCanonicalSHA256 = \\\"d3eca9063c0f7b7a6abc38a7f53c5d6c01bdbc076886e19a2c66e0a87693e58a\\\"\\n437:\\tif gotDigest != reviewedOwnershipCanonicalSHA256 {\\n438:\\t\\treturn Report{}, fail(\\\"ownership registry projection digest %s differs from reviewed %s\\\", gotDigest, reviewedOwnershipCanonicalSHA256)\\n778:func canonicalNumericSection(identifier string) string {\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 9206,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 2302,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
