DATA RACE; cmd5 38 ok; 14 fuzz smokes ok; cmd25 `task-board validate` exit 0 with 190 pre-existing MISSING_ACTIVITY warnings): the race run (`-timeout 25m`), the coverage run, the fuzz smokes, the JSON census and `task-board validate` were not rerun by me.\\n\\n## Checklist routing\\nAll producer items verified as checked; reviewer items \\\"Implementation matches AC\\\", \\\"Solution fits project architecture\\\", \\\"Tests green\\\", \\\"Gate … attacked, not read\\\" and \\\"verdict evidence added and status routed\\\" checked. Verdict recorded with `accept_cr(TASK-260830-219okr, revision=4, evidence=TASK-260830-219okr_review-verdict-rev4.md)` → `integrating`; checkpoint and integration belong to the bound producer role/archetype (`developer`/`implementer`) and the orchestrator.\\n\\n## Reviewer plants (committed-suite results, two runs)\\n\\n| Mutant | Kind | run1 | run2 | Expected committed killer | Failing committed tests (first 3) |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| R8-frame-admits-5.1 | narrowing | KILLED | KILLED | TestPeerOfferRefusals/frame-versions | TestPeerOfferRefusals/frame-versions, TestPeerOfferRefusals |\\n| R12-negotiate-unknown-config-falls-back-to-legacy | narrowing | KILLED | KILLED | TestNegotiateUnknownGeneration | TestNegotiateUnknownGeneration/unknown--x-2.0.0, TestNegotiateUnknownGeneration/unknown--x-3.0.0, TestNegotiateUnknownGeneration/unknown--x-4.0.0 |\\n| R19-directory-code-swap-same-exit | class-swap-same-exit | KILLED | KILLED | TestPeerExposure/2.0.0 | TestPeerExposure/2.0.0, TestPeerExposure |\\n| R20-backend-code-swap-same-exit | class-swap-same-exit | KILLED | KILLED | TestPeerExposure | TestPeerExposure/2.0.0, TestPeerExposure/3.0.0, TestPeerExposure |\\n| R1-dup-admitted | narrowing | KILLED | KILLED | TestPeerOfferRefusals/mixed/duplicate | TestPeerOfferRefusals/mixed/duplicate, TestPeerOfferRefusals/mixed, TestPeerOfferRefusals |\\n| R2-negotiate-peer-set-plus-5 | narrowing | KILLED | KILLED | TestConfig4NeverDowngrades | TestConfig4NeverDowngrades, TestLegacyNeverSelectsRPC5, TestNegotiateMatrix/4.0.0-x-2.0.0 |\\n| R3-select-admits-5-without-peer | narrowing | KILLED | KILLED | TestConfig4NeverDowngrades | TestConfig4NeverDowngrades, TestNegotiateMatrix/4.0.0-x-2.0.0, TestNegotiateMatrix/4.0.0-x-3.0.0 |\\n| R4-shape-admits-any-extra-keys | narrowing | KILLED | KILLED | TestPeerOfferRefusals/shape/extra-error-key | TestNoFallbackSurface/extension-member, TestNoFallbackSurface, TestPeerOfferRefusals/shape/v3-bound-in-v2-frame |\\n| R5-exposure-code-when-negotiated | narrowing | KILLED | KILLED | TestPeerExposure/3.0.0 | TestPeerExposure/3.0.0, TestPeerExposure/4.0.0, TestPeerExposure/5.0.0 |\\n| R6-v5-exact-exempt | narrowing | KILLED | KILLED | TestPeerOfferRefusals/shape/v5-inexact-rpc | TestPeerOfferRefusals/shape/v5-inexact-rpc, TestPeerOfferRefusals/shape, TestPeerOfferRefusals |\\n| R7-refusal-code-same-exit | class-swap-same-exit | KILLED | KILLED | TestNegotiateMatrix/3.0.0-x-5.0.0 | TestLegacyNeverSelectsRPC5, TestNegotiateMatrix/1.0.0-x-3.0.0, TestNegotiateMatrix/1.0.0-x-4.0.0 |\\n| R9-unknown-config-4.0.1 | narrowing | KILLED | KILLED | TestLocalMajors/unknown-4.0.1 | TestLocalMajors/unknown-4.0.1, TestLocalMajors, TestNegotiateUnknownGeneration/unknown-4.0.1-x-2.0.0 |\\n| R13-negotiate-malformed-offer-trusts-frame | narrowing | KILLED | KILLED | TestNoFallbackSurface/extension-member | TestNoFallbackSurface/extension-member, TestNoFallbackSurface |\\n| R16-activation-gains-inventory-member | structural | KILLED | KILLED | TestExposureCarriesNoInventory | TestExposureCarriesNoInventory |\\n| R17-peerview-gains-count-member | structural | KILLED | KILLED | TestExposureCarriesNoInventory | TestExposureCarriesNoInventory |\\n| R18-invalid-config-same-exit-code-swap | class-swap-same-exit | KILLED | KILLED | TestLocalMajors/unknown- | TestLocalMajors/unknown-, TestLocalMajors/unknown-5.0.0, TestLocalMajors/unknown-3.0 |\\n| S1-frame-admits-3.0.1 | narrowing | KILLED | KILLED | Tes