config-durable-migration\\\"\\n ],\\n \\\"coverage\\\": \\\"unevidenced\\\",\\n \\\"gap\\\": \\\"AssessCompatibility implements the Section 17.4 read-only downgrade assessment, but no clause of Section 17.4 is enumerated against an acceptance case.\\\"\\n}\\n======\\n{\\n \\\"kind\\\": \\\"section_binding\\\",\\n \\\"keys\\\": [\\n  \\\"section:11.2\\\"\\n ],\\n \\\"production\\\": {\\n  \\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/catalog/catalog.go\\\",\\n  \\\"declaration\\\": \\\"ForRelease\\\"\\n },\\n \\\"acceptance_cases\\\": [\\n  \\\"catalog-v050-exact\\\"\\n ],\\n \\\"coverage\\\": \\\"unevidenced\\\",\\n \\\"gap\\\": \\\"ForRelease returns the reviewed typed catalog rows that reference 11.2. TASK-260830-z1yxg9 adds rpcwire.DecodeRequest/DecodeResponse structural envelopes, request-ID/version correlation, 14-key hello maps, nonce echo and limit floors for RPC 2/3/4/5, and the hostchannel Serve/Dial authenticated hello consumer with its refusal table (internal/hostchannel, HC-HELLO/HC-DISPATCH families). No clause of 11.2 is enumerated against an acceptance case, so the registry makes no clause-level claim about the 5 obligations it carries.\\\"\\n}\\n======\\n{\\n \\\"kind\\\": \\\"section_binding\\\",\\n \\\"keys\\\": [\\n  \\\"section:11.3\\\"\\n ],\\n \\\"production\\\": {\\n  \\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/catalog/catalog.go\\\",\\n  \\\"declaration\\\": \\\"ForRelease\\\"\\n },\\n \\\"acceptance_cases\\\": [\\n  \\\"catalog-v050-exact\\\"\\n ],\\n \\\"coverage\\\": \\\"unevidenced\\\",\\n \\\"gap\\\": \\\"ForRelease returns the reviewed typed catalog rows that reference 11.3. rpcwire now validates inventory.roots namespace/cardinality (6/7/8/8 across RPC 2/3/4/5) and matches roots to requested namespaces, and hostchannel dispatches authorized post-hello inventory.roots calls through the current-generation gate (TestInventoryRootsThroughChannel). No Merkle digest verification, schema membership or object exchange exists. No clause of 11.3 is enumerated against an acceptance case, so the registry makes no clause-level claim about the 27 obligations it carries.\\\"\\n}\\n======\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2426,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 607,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
