lf-minted keys, partial or malformed reads, and semantic ownership drift.\n3064|GitHub Actions invokes the gate directly before generation, tests, vet, and\n3065|build:\n3066|\n3067|```bash\n3068|go run ./internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck\n3069|go run ./internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck -section 6.2\n3070|```\n3071|\n3072|The repeated `-section` form is the Story-scope production gate. It resolves\n3073|each assigned subsection, and every heading in a same-top-level range, against\n(more lines below)","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
