ajors` never yields 1, so only a direct `Select` caller observes the arm |\n+| No-coercion shapes at the composed entry | `TestNoMajorSelectedByCoercion` (only-higher, only-lower, empty, duplicate, unsorted, out-of-range-count) and `TestMajor1RejectedThroughNegotiation` through `Negotiate` |\n+| Registry bindings and digest re-pin | Done by this leaf: 11.2 partial 3/5, 11.3 sliver 1/27, 17.1 partial 3/6, 17.4 sliver 1/4; digest `1500e259…`; 17.2/17.3 keep their existing unevidenced owners |\n","final_result":true}}}
