ked `-race` (38 ok, no DATA RACE) and all 17 fuzz smokes. `task-board.config.json` gains exactly the 3 new fuzz rows, stated explicitly.\n\nTwo mid-session file incidents (a grep-redirect truncation and a corpus cleanup overreach) were both restored byte-identical from the checkpoint; final status shows only candidate paths.","reason":null}}
